          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "ALDBURY                       STATION ROAD SP 9612                                                   (South side) 12/5                                                      Nos. 1, and 2 30.11.66                                                  Church Cottages GV II House, now 2 houses. C16 crosswing, C17 taller hall range to W, lower C18 W kitchen extension, mid C19 E gabled extension. Timber frame exposed with red brick sill and infill. Chequered red and black brick W end extension. Red brick E extension. Steep old red tile roofs. A T-shaped hall and crosswing plan now 2 storeys throughout with door into hall range next E crosswing and W gable chimney. Lower and shallower W kitchen extension with rear wing. E extension adds a 2 window gable to front. 2-light sliding casement windows to each part. Hall range and W extension now form No. 1. Glazed door with crosswing and hipped tiled shared open porch. (Davis (1980) No. 32). Listing NGR: SP9639012403"
    }
  ],
